{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","冰风龙卷"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","얼음 회오리바람"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤魔法剑吸引附近敌人向中心聚拢，并造成伤害和定身。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","마법검을 소환하여 주변 적을 중심으로 모아 대미지를 입히고 결박한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","埃隆将双剑力量合二为一，选择一个地图格，吸引附近2格范围内敌人将其向中心聚拢，短暂延迟后产生爆炸，对2格范围内的敌人造成250% + 20% ATK伤害，并定身3秒。优先选择敌人最密集的区域释放。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","에이론이 쌍검의 힘을 하나로 합쳐 맵 1칸을 선택해 주변 2칸 범위 내의 적을 중심부로 끌어들인 다음 잠시 지연된 후 폭발한다. 이때, 2칸 범위 내의 적에게 250% + 20% ATK의 대미지를 입히고 3초간 결박 상태로 만든다. 적이 가장 밀집된 구역을 우선 선택하여 시전한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":64,"end":70,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":93,"end":99,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":60,"end":74,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":78,"end":80,"tooltip_key":"keyword:immobilize"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":89,"end":103,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":118,"end":120,"tooltip_key":"keyword:immobilize"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至270% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 270% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至290% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 290% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/c