其身后直线上2格的敌人造成220% + 20% ATK伤害，降低40%魔抗，持续5秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","에이론이 전방 부채꼴 3칸 범위 내의 적에게 110% + 10% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 급속을 50 감소시키며 5초간 지속된다. 이후 목표를 찔러 목표 및 그 뒤 직선상 2칸 내의 적에게 220% + 20% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 마법 방어력을 40% 감소시키며 5초간 지속된다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":81,"end":87,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":111,"end":117,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":77,"end":91,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":107,"end":121,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","挥砍的伤害提升至115% + 10% ATK，戳刺的伤害提升至230% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","베기 대미지가 115% + 10% ATK로, 찌르기 대미지가 230% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","挥砍的伤害提升至120% + 10% ATK，戳刺的伤害提升至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","베기 대미지가 120% + 10% ATK로, 찌르기 대미지가 240% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","挥砍的伤害提升至125% + 10% ATK，戳刺的伤害提升至250% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","베기 대미지가 125% + 10% ATK로, 찌르기 대미지가 250% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","凛风护盾"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","극풍 실드"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","为自身添加护盾，并提供闪避效果。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","자신에게 실드를 부여하며 회피 효과를 제공한다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","埃隆为自身添加一个护盾，护盾可抵挡280% + 30% ATK的伤害，持续10秒，护盾存在期间，自身获得50%闪避率。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","에이론이 자신에게 실드 하나를 부여한다. 실드는 280% + 30% ATK의 대미지를 막을 수 있